    [
      "Films only.",
      "Wikipedia's list mixes in TV — 24, The Bear's \"Review\", a radio soap opera. The 34 series, episodes and broadcasts were screened out, and a couple of series hiding behind bare years (The Pitt, Adolescence) were caught by their Wikidata typing. Made-for-TV films stay, flagged."
    ],
    "From the list in Wikipedia's \"Real time (media)\"; runtimes from Wikidata and film articles."
